<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Amit Chopra initiated coverage of International Business Machines Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/8 to 138.</p>
</text>
